FATAL_OBJECTIONS: []
REQUIRED_EVIDENCE: [
  ">=1 non-Snowflake model family with default_prompt_name=null + shipped prompts to confirm the packaging convention generalizes beyond arctic-embed (theory_skeptic item 1, unrebutted)",
  "Bootstrap CIs or seed-variance on R@10 deltas — NFCorpus +2.9pp on n=323 queries is indistinguishable from noise without a CI (theory_skeptic item 2, unrebutted)",
  "In-situ LangChain HuggingFaceEmbeddings.embed_query() and LlamaIndex HuggingFaceEmbedding e2e run to empirically confirm source-code hypothesis (evaluation_prosecutor mandatory baseline, unrebutted)"
]
