  "E5 / Wang 2022 (arXiv:2212.03533) — mechanism attribution",
  "INSTRUCTOR / TART (arXiv:2212.09741) — instruction-conditioned embedding prior art",
  "ST Migration Guide + config_sentence_transformers.json prompt semantics — the decisive seam is documented ST behavior",
  "MTEB PR#1221 (Aug 2024) — prior ecosystem recognition of the integration-must-honor-shipped-prompts problem",
